ion AI</a>, <a href="https://slack.com/features/ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">Slack AI</a>, <a href="https://copilot.microsoft.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">Microsoft Copilot</a> — have each shipped AI surfaces bounded to their own walled gardens.
