        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-5">
          <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--color-accent)] font-bold mb-2">Per-user anomaly detection</div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-3">Outliers get flagged the same day, not the same month.</h4>
          <ul class="text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
            <li>· <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Daily cost-per-user job</strong> — flag any AU whose 24h cost exceeds 5× the cohort median.</li>
            <li>· <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Investigate</strong> — is this a power-user we should upgrade? Or a bot / scraper / abuse pattern?</li>
